Source: home.inc
     1 				; Start menu, help and convert pages. Each page is a read-only document in the Craft text
     2 				; format (a stream of lines with paragraph markers) that the normal page engine draws, so the
     3 				; scaled logo uses the same width/height markers as the editor. While a page is shown the
     4 				; user's document stays at DOC; cl, cc, top, anyv, lm and rm are saved and restored.
     5 				; hmode: 0 editor, 1 home, 2 help, 3 convert.
     6 = 0005			EL0  = 5
     7 = 0008			NENT = 8
