     1 				; Selection, clipboard (Cut / Copy / Paste), Find, Find next, Replace, Goto line, Home / End. See docs/EDIT.md.
     2 				; A selection is an anchor (^S mark) and the cursor, both kept as raw pointers into the document. While it
     3 				; is shown, two inverse codes (4) are inserted at its ends; they are removed again before any other work
     4 				; (ex_hloff), so the document never keeps them. The clipboard holds raw document bytes, style codes included.
     5
     6 				.macro cmp16 a,b
